UPDATE companies SET description='Winona Foods, based in Howard, Wisconsin, traces its roots to 1995 when its managing partners, drawing on experience at family-owned cheese companies, established the business. The company began full operations at a new Howard facility in January 2018, which houses a commercial kitchen, product performance center, conversion and distribution center, cooler distribution center, and direct rail access.

The company manufactures a range of cheese products including natural, specialty, imitation, vegan, Italian, and performance cheeses, and performs conversion operations such as shredding, slicing, cubing, dicing, and chunking. It also provides co-packing services, industrial ingredients, and supplies the food service and retail segments. With manufacturing distribution centers strategically located across the United States, Winona Foods handles development, manufacturing, packaging, storage, and delivery.

Winona Foods serves dairy manufacturers, industrial ingredient buyers, food service operators, retail chains, and co-packing clients. Its direct sales force and national broker network reach customers across the food industry.

The company states its mission is to be the industry leader by providing exceptional solutions, service, quality, and value, emphasizing a dedication to the highest quality portfolio and exceeding industry standards.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cheese manufacturing", "Cheese conversion (shredding, slicing, cubing, dicing, chunking)", "Co-packing", "Industrial ingredients supply", "Food service supply", "Retail supply", "Product development", "Commercial kitchen testing", "Warehousing and distribution", "Direct rail access"], "industries": ["Food service", "Industrial ingredients", "Retail", "Co-packing", "Dairy manufacturing"], "materials": ["Natural cheese", "Specialty cheese", "Imitation cheese", "Vegan cheese", "Italian cheese", "Performance cheese"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Direct rail access at Howard facility", "Commercial kitchen and product performance center for product testing", "Conversion and distribution center with cooler storage", "Manufacturing distribution centers strategically located across the U.S.", "Direct sales force and national broker network"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1995 -> /about", "Headquarters in Howard, Wisconsin -> /about and home page", "New facility began full operation January 2018 with commercial kitchen, product performance center, conversion and distribution center, cooler distribution center, direct rail access -> /about", "Cheese product types: natural, specialty, imitation, vegan, Italian, performance -> /about", "Cheese conversion styles: shreds, slices, cubes, dicing, chunking -> /about", "Services: co-packing, industrial ingredients, food service, retail -> home page and /about", "Industries served: dairy manufacturers, industrial and food service customers -> /about", "Mission: industry leader providing exceptional solutions, service, quality, value -> /about", "Direct sales force and national broker network -> home page", "Manuf