UPDATE companies SET description='Wood Touch LLC operates from a shop in Pine Brook, New Jersey. The company is family-owned and operated, though its founding year and founders'' names are not publicly disclosed. The business began as a woodworking shop focused on custom rustic and modern wood products, emphasizing locally sourced materials and personal craftsmanship.

The shop manufactures a range of custom wood items including live-edge tables, epoxy resin river tables, hollowed ceiling beams, fireplace mantels, barn doors, conference tables, floating shelves, pergolas, gazebos, and barn wood siding. All wood is sourced from New Jersey, New York, and Connecticut, then designed and built in North Jersey.

Wood Touch serves designers, builders, and home-business owners. Its products appear in residential projects such as dining tables, desktops, and bed frames, as well as commercial settings like restaurant tables and conference rooms. The company also supplies raw live-edge slabs of black walnut, maple, and white oak for further fabrication.

