UPDATE companies SET description='WoodWorx Supply, Inc. opened in 2015 in Elmhurst, Illinois. The company was founded to supply commercial wood coatings and paint supplies, growing into the largest Renner distributor in the Midwest.

The company stocks a broad range of finishing products including Renner wood coatings, Mirka abrasives, SATA spray equipment, and Apollo HVLP systems. Its in-house paint lab performs color and stain matching using industry-standard quality-control procedures, and the staff provides technical advising drawn from over 20 years of hands-on refinishing experience. Local delivery is available for qualifying customers.

WoodWorx serves professional woodworkers, refinishers, and contractors across the Midwest and nationally online. Its customer base includes shops handling commercial wood coating projects, residential refinishing, and PVC applications such as windows, doors, and fences using RennerPlast systems.

The business differentiates itself by requiring every employee to have personal woodworking knowledge, ensuring that product recommendations reflect practical experience. The paint lab’s specialized equipment allows consistent scaling of color matches, and the company’s long-standing manufacturer relationships give it priority access to product lines like Renner’s 15-year-warranty PVC coatings.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Color matching", "Stain matching", "Technical advising", "Local delivery", "Paint lab quality control", "Wood coating distribution", "Abrasives distribution", "Spray equipment distribution"], "industries": ["Woodworking", "Refinishing", "Commercial wood coatings", "Home finishing", "PVC coating"], "materials": ["Wood coatings", "PVC coatings", "Stains", "Fillers", "Abrasives"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Largest Renner supplier in the Midwest", "In-house paint lab with industry-standard quality control for precise color and stain matching", "Employees required to have personal woodworking and refinishing experience", "Over 20 years of refinishing experience backing technical advising", "Local delivery service for qualified customers"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2015 in Elmhurst, Illinois -> /about-us", "Largest Renner supplier in the Midwest -> /about-us", "Paint lab uses industry standards for quality control and color matching -> /about-us", "Employees required to have personal woodworking and refinishing knowledge -> /about-us", "Over 20 years of refinishing experience advising customers -> /services", "Services: advising, delivery, color matching, stain matching -> /services", "Product categories: Renner coatings, Mirka abrasives, SATA spray equipment, Apollo HVLP, etc. -> /", "RennerPlast PVC coatings with 15-year warranty -> /", "Serves professional woodworkers, refinishers, contractors locally and online -> /about-us", "Specializes in commercial wood coatings, paint supplies -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "specializes in commercial wood coatings, paint supplies, and is the largest Renner supplier in the Midwest.", "founded_year": "2015", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='woodworx-supply-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Woodcraft Mill & Cabinet has operated from West Jordan, Utah since 1996. The family‑owned shop began as a local cabinetry workshop and has grown to serve homeowners across the Wasatch Front, from Ogden to Provo and into Park City.

The company designs, manufactures, and installs custom cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms, home offices, laundry rooms, closets, mudrooms, and living spaces, as well as custom wood mantels and millwork. All fabrication takes place in its West Jordan facility, where a CNC router provides precision cutting followed by hand‑sanding and finishing. The shop reports a tolerance of 1/16 inch and has completed more than 2,000 projects, each built from hand‑sorted premium hardwoods such as maple, cherry, walnut, oak, and exotic species. Finishes are mixed and applied in‑house.

Woodcraft serves residential homeowners undertaking remodels or new construction, and also partners with builders across Utah to supply cabinetry for new homes. Its service area covers Salt Lake, Davis, Weber, Wasatch, and Summit counties, including cities such as Salt Lake City, West Jordan, Holladay, Park City, and Ogden.

The firm emphasizes complete control from raw lumber to installed product, citing its owned mill, hand‑sorted lumber, CNC precision with hand finishing, custom mixed finishes, and direct communication between client and craftsmen as differentiators. It is a member of the National Kitchen & Bath Association.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet design", "Custom cabinet manufacturing", "Cabinet installation", "Cabinet refinishing and repair", "Appliance integration (Wolf, Sub-Zero, Cove, Best)", "Custom wood mantels and millwork", "Custom closet systems", "Custom built-ins", "Kitchen cabinet remodels", "Bathroom vanity fabrication", "Home office cabinetry", "Laundry room cabinetry", "Mudroom and entryway cabinetry", "Living room cabinetry and shelving", "Pantry cabinetry"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Home remodeling", "New home construction", "Kitchen and bath industry"], "materials": ["Maple", "Cherry", "Walnut", "Oak", "Exotic hardwoods"], "equipment": ["CNC router"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "1/16 inch precision tolerance", "built_on": ["Own mill for complete quality control from raw lumber to installed cabinetry", "Hand\u2011sorted premium hardwoods (maple, cherry, walnut, oak, exotic species)", "CNC precision cutting with hand\u2011finished surfaces", "Custom mixed finishes applied in\u2011house", "Cabinets built to 1/16\u2033 tolerance with direct client\u2011craftsman communication"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1996 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "West Jordan shop location -> /about", "2000+ projects completed -> /about", "1/16\" precision tolerance -> /about", "Own mill for complete quality control -> /about", "Hand-sorted premium hardwoods (maple, cherry, walnut, oak, exotic) -> /about", "CNC router for precision cutting -> /about", "Custom mixed finishes applied in-house -> /about", "Direct communication with craftsmen -> /about", "NKBA member -> /about", "Service areas across Salt Lake, Davis, Weber, Wasatch, Summit counties -> /services", "Appliance integration with Wolf, Sub-Zero, Cove, Best -> /", "Custom cabinetry for every room (kitchen, bath, office, laundry, closet, mudroom, living, mantels) -> /services", "Partners with builders for new construction -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We don''t assemble parts from a box. Every cabinet is milled, fabricated, and finished under one roof in our West Jordan shop.", "founded_year": "1996", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='woodcraft-mill-cabinet' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Woodcrafters of Virginia is a locally owned and operated supplier of architectural mouldings and millwork based in Virginia Beach, Virginia. The company has served the Mid-Atlantic region for over 30 years, providing trim products to builders, contractors, and designers.

The company operates an on-site production facility where it manufactures custom mouldings and millwork using regionally sourced Southern Yellow Pine and other hardwoods. Its catalog includes nearly 2,000 profiles, and the shop regularly creates new tooling to match existing trim or produce new designs. In addition to custom millwork, Woodcrafters stocks a range of building components including pine and poplar boards, Azek PVC trim, Western Red Cedar siding, interior and exterior doors, stair parts, columns, decking, and rail systems.

Woodcrafters serves contractors, builders, designers, architects, and property owners across residential and commercial projects. Its customers include top builders and trim carpenters in the Mid-Atlantic region, and the company works on projects ranging from historic restorations and renovations to new construction and additions.

The company emphasizes its ability to match or restore any existing moulding detail, a large selection of domestic and exotic hardwoods, and a team of skilled woodcrafters with deep industry knowledge. It positions itself as the Mid-Atlantic builder’s primary source for home finish building supplies, backed by over three decades of local operation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom moulding", "Custom millwork production", "Tooling custom grind", "Profile matching", "Design consultation", "Value engineering", "Delivery", "Blueprint estimations", "Custom door fabrication", "Arched casing fabrication", "Bracket fabrication", "Wainscoting fabrication", "Column fabrication"], "industries": ["Contractors", "Builders", "Designers", "Architects", "Property owners", "Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Historic restoration", "Renovations", "Remodels", "Additions", "New construction"], "materials": ["Southern Yellow Pine", "Pine", "Poplar", "Hardwoods", "Exotic hardwoods", "Azek PVC", "Western Red Cedar", "Polymer composites"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Outstanding customer service", "Skilled woodcrafters with top-of-industry knowledge", "Large selection of domestic and exotic hardwoods", "Ability to match or restore any existing moulding or trim detail", "Locally owned and operated for over 30 years"], "facts_used": ["Location: Virginia Beach, Virginia -> db", "Locally owned and operated for over 30 years -> /about", "On-site production facility manufacturing custom mouldings and millwork -> /about", "Nearly 2,000 profiles in catalog -> /about", "Custom tooling to match existing trim -> /about", "Stock pine, poplar, hardwoods, Azek PVC, Western Red Cedar -> /about", "Sell interior/exterior doors, stair parts, columns, decking, rail systems -> /about", "Serve contractors, builders, designers, architects, property owners -> /", "Residential and commercial projects, histo