UPDATE companies SET description='WorldPak Flexible Packaging was founded in 2003 in Reno, Nevada, as a joint venture between CC‑Pak of Reno and Kunshan Jiapu Packaging of Jiangsu, China. In 2005 the company relocated to a 110,000‑square‑foot facility that expanded converting capacity and added warehousing for raw materials and customer inventory.

