UPDATE companies SET description='Yukon Medical, LLC operates from Durham, North Carolina, where it develops needleless systems for the preparation and delivery of injectable medications.

The company designs and manufactures two primary product lines: the Vialok® Vial Access Device, which provides secure vial access for medication preparation, and the Arisure® Closed System Transfer Device, a needleless, membrane-to-membrane platform for hazardous drug handling. Both systems are engineered for high performance while remaining intentionally simple, allowing clinicians to focus on care rather than device complexity.

Yukon Medical serves healthcare providers across clinical, pharmacy, and home-care settings. Its devices are used by clinicians and healthcare teams in hospitals and clinics for hazardous drug transfer and dependable vial access. The company emphasizes that its solutions integrate into real-world workflows, supporting safer and more consistent medication preparation across shifts and experience levels.

