UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Nashville, Tennessee, blc TEXTILES provides textile sourcing and custom manufacturing services for businesses across multiple sectors. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it operates from a headquarters on Sawyer Brown Road and emphasizes a partnership model with a single overseas manufacturing source.

