UPDATE companies SET description='35th Avenue Sew & Vac is a family-owned retailer of sewing machines, vacuums, and fabrics based in Chandler, Arizona, with additional locations in Phoenix and El Mirage. The company has served the Phoenix metropolitan area for approximately 40 years and is now operated by the second generation of the founding family.

